{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>保育人士表示，澳洲聖誕島（Christmas Island）上有超過1億隻紅蟹正展開一年一度的遷徙，由森林向海洋進發，抵達海岸線後便會進行繁殖。影片中可見，聖誕島國家公園內有大批紅蟹在島上各處出沒。澳洲公園管理局（Parks Australia）指出，紅蟹橫越森林、道路與橋樑後，會在下弦月期間、黎明前的退潮時產卵。（法新社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:23:59.655324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:59:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:37:21.100270+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:17:29.150869+00:00","content_hash":"af8019f7f10029413693fb805dc7750f79ae19877981c4faf5c44d9c828b5b21","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}